WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.944
Is this really Brett?

2
00:00:02.344 --> 00:00:03.465
Not quite.

3
00:00:03.865 --> 00:00:06.300
You're watching my AI assistant.

4
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.296
It uses my face and my voice, and

5
00:00:08.296 --> 00:00:11.060
every word it says, I wrote and
approved myself.

6
00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:12.511
I made it so you can hear my

7
00:00:12.511 --> 00:00:15.966
answers to the questions people
ask most, any time you like.

8
00:00:15.966 --> 00:00:19.973
When you're ready to talk with the
real me, book a short conversation.

9
00:00:20.173 --> 00:00:21.847
I'd love to meet you.
